<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vencemos started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vencemos started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- HSBC James Capel said it had started coverage of Venezuelan cement producer Vencemos SA with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Vencemos has emerged as the most efficient producer within the Cemex SA group, as both a successful exporter and domestic player with 49 percent market share in Venezuela,&quot; HSBC James Capel said in a March 25 report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;... A range of valuation parameters indicate that the shares are fairly valued at the current price against its peers.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were off five bolivars at 1285 bolivars in Caracas.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
